#215
surfer man~
the surfer~
A young man stands near a rack of strange boards.
~
The surfer leans up against a wooden rack, which is full of long wooden
boards, shaped a little like boats.  "Hey, I got surfboards right here, if
you're interested.  Some killer waves out there on the break.  The trick is to
head out as far as you can without leaving the break, and then look for the
spots where you see the waves building.  Then just "SURF", and you'll be
riding em home in no time!  Just say 'sure, dude' and I can hook you up."
~
16777283 0 1000 C
40 0 -145 4d30+1255 3d5+30
500 0
112 112 1
13 13 13 13 13 13 13
0 0 0 0 0
0 3 0 0 1 1 0
0 0 31 0 0 0 0 0
> death_prog 50~
say Fer sure dude!  Thats like, so uncool!
emote goes to the great Pipeline in the sky...~
> speech_prog 'sure dude'~
if goldamt($n) < 6000
  mpechoat $n You need at least 6000 coins for one of theses babies!
else
  mpoload 215
  give surfboard $n
  say Here you go $n.  If you need help surfing, just look at me!
  mpforce $n give 6000 coins surfer
endif
~
> greet_prog 25~
if sex($n) == 2
  say Hey baby, you wanna buy a surfboard?
  else
    if sex($n) == 1
       say Hey dude, you wanna buy a surfboard?
    endif
endif
~
|
